 "Started {name}": "Empezó {name}",
 "Ended {name}": "Terminó {name}",
 "These are counts of what was recorded. What a result or a flare means is a question for the next visit, and any change to a prescription is the prescriber’s to make.": "Estos son conteos de lo que se registró. Qué significa un resultado o un brote es pregunta para la próxima consulta, y cualquier cambio a una receta le toca a quien la recetó.",
 "An appointment": "Una cita",
 "{who}, on {shortDate}, {value} ago. Everything here was recorded from the day after it.": "{who}, el {shortDate}, hace {value}. Todo lo de aquí se registró desde el día siguiente.",
